# Portable docs stay in-repo

Root `INSTALL*.md` is first-run install only. Root `README.md` / `README.en.md` is an index (layout, daily run, links) — do not copy install steps, package tables, or account lists into it. `workspace/README.md` describes `sources` / `kb` / `scratch` only.

- Do **not** add links to `myappx-plugins` (extension catalog README, AI Copilot setup, knowledge base, etc.).
- In-repo links are OK (`service/README-service.md`, `README.md`, `INSTALL.zh-CN.md`).
- Extension install order and URLs may stay as facts in INSTALL; do not point readers at other repos for those topics.
- Keep Chinese / English pairs in sync (`README.md` ↔ `README.en.md`, `INSTALL.zh-CN.md` ↔ `INSTALL.en.md`).
